---

---

<section id="about" class="py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-sm text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">
      // à-propos
    </h2>
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text">À propos de moi</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <div
      class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-raised border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-4">
          Infra, réseau, automatisation — et un peu de code.
        </h4>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Plongé dans l'informatique depuis mon plus jeune âge, j'ai choisi de
          transformer cette passion en métier. Diplômé en BTS SIO option SISR,
          je rejoins la Licence Informatique (LID) à Dole à partir de septembre.
          Mon objectif ? Garantir la fiabilité, la sécurité et l'automatisation
          des réseaux d'entreprise — tout en gardant un pied dans le développement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/docs/Leo_Gruet_CV.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-surface font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl w-fit text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"
          ></path></svg
        >
        Télécharger mon CV
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="md:col-span-1 bg-surface-raised border border-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative min-h-75"
    >
      <img
        src="/assets/profile.jpg"
        alt="Léo Gruet"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
        width="400"
        height="400"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-surface-raised border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors"
    >
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-6 h-6"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01"
          ></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h4 class="font-mono text-xs text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">
        infra & réseau
      </h4>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Gestion de l'infrastructure au quotidien, virtualisation sous Proxmox,
        configuration réseau et support utilisateur.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-surface-raised border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors"
    >
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-6 h-6"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"
          ></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h4 class="font-mono text-xs text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">
        diplômé sio
      </h4>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Formation spécialisée en Solutions d'Infrastructure, Systèmes et
        Réseaux. Focus sur la sécurité et le déploiement d'OS.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-surface-raised border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors"
    >
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-6 h-6"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h4 class="font-mono text-xs text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">
        dev
      </h4>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Veille technologique active, création de laboratoires virtuels
        (Homelab), automatisation de processus et bouts de code utiles.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
